        <h3 class="dossier-title">Vicuna &bull; 32-bit Embedded RVV Coprocessor (Zve32f/x)</h3>
        <span class="dossier-sub">vproc Project &bull; Apache-2.0 &bull; SystemVerilog</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Stack -->
      <div class="dossier-specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">ISA:</span><span class="s-v"><code>RV32IMF_Zve32f (Vector 1.0)</code></span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Lanes:</span><span class="s-v">1 SIMD Lane (32b Datapath)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Vector Length:</span><span class="s-v">128 bits (VLEN)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">VRF Architecture:</span><span class="s-v">BRAM / SRAM Banked VRF</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Host / Bus Interface:</span><span class="s-v">Dual OBI / AXI4-Lite (128-bit Memory)</span></div>
