      <div class="dossier-body">
        <p>Vicuna is an open-source 32-bit vector coprocessor implementing the RVV 1.0 Zve32f and Zve32x embedded profiles. Tailored for edge AI and low-power microcontrollers (Ibex, CV32E40P), Vicuna features a microcoded vector sequencer and a 128-bit memory bus that sustains 6.4 Ops/cycle on quantized INT8 matrix operations.</p>

        <!-- RTL Configuration Parameters Table -->
        <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #151b20;">&bull; Key RTL Configuration Parameters</h4>
        <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <table class="data-table" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
