        <h3 class="dossier-title">CV32E40P &bull; 4-Stage In-Order Core with XpulpV2 Packed SIMD &amp; DSP</h3>
        <span class="dossier-sub">OpenHW Group &bull; Solderpad-0.51 &bull; SystemVerilog</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Stack -->
      <div class="dossier-specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">ISA:</span><span class="s-v"><code>RV32IMFCXpulpV2 (Packed SIMD &amp; DSP)</code></span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Lanes:</span><span class="s-v">1 Lane (32b GPR Slicing)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Vector Length:</span><span class="s-v">32 bits (Scalar GPRs)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">VRF Architecture:</span><span class="s-v">None (Zero-VRF &bull; Uses 32&times;32b Integer GPRs)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Host / Bus Interface:</span><span class="s-v">OBI (Open Bus Interface)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Silicon Footprint:</span><span class="s-v"><strong>~24 kGE (TSMC 28nm)</strong></span></div>
