        <h3 class="dossier-title">Integrated Matrix Extension &bull; 2D Tile Tensor Coprocessor (IME / SME)</h3>
        <span class="dossier-sub">RISC-V Non-ISA Community &bull; Apache-2.0 &bull; SystemVerilog</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Stack -->
      <div class="dossier-specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">ISA:</span><span class="s-v"><code>RISC-V Matrix Extension (SME / IME)</code></span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Lanes:</span><span class="s-v">16 Parallel Lanes &bull; 2D Outer-Product Mesh</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Vector Length:</span><span class="s-v">8&times;8 Matrix Tile Registers</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">VRF Architecture:</span><span class="s-v">1D VRF (512b) + 2D Accumulator Tiles (ZA)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Host / Bus Interface:</span><span class="s-v">AXI4 / TileLink 256-bit Bus</span></div>
