      <div class="dossier-body">
        <p>The Integrated Matrix Extension (IME) bridges 1D vector computing and 2D spatial systolic arrays. By introducing 2D accumulator tile registers (ZA) and outer-product instructions (<code>mopa</code>), IME executes matrix multiplication directly on 2D register state with spatial data reuse, achieving 128 Ops/cycle while preserving general-purpose vector flexibility.</p>

        <!-- RTL Configuration Parameters Table -->
        <h4 style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #151b20;">&bull; Key RTL Configuration Parameters</h4>
        <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <table class="data-table" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Default</th><th>Silicon Impact</th><th>Description</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
